This project independently implements the Bluesky Jetstream jss0 archive format.
Protocol reference: https://github.com/bluesky-social/jetstream
The native.jss test fixture is generated from synthetic records using the official
Jetstream segment writer at 3fa54fdbb0f47ad3aa43de78a6fbbd8dc362f81d.
Jetstream is available under Apache-2.0 OR MIT. No Jetstream runtime is bundled.

The connector depends on, but does not vendor, Databricks Labs Lakeflow Community
Connectors (Apache-2.0): https://github.com/databrickslabs/lakeflow-community-connectors
